    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "attr",
      "line": 6,
      "zh": "宝石消除网页版：交换相邻宝石三连消除，4 连生成条纹宝石、L/T 形生成炸弹、5 连生成彩虹宝石，15 个步数关卡加限时模式，连锁 combo 爽感拉满。",
      "en": "Gem matching for the web: swap neighbouring gems to match three, match 4 for a striped gem, L/T shapes for a bomb, 5 in a row for a rainbow gem; 15 move-limited levels plus a timed mode, with big chain combos."
    },
