    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 101,
      "zh": "🖱️ 拖动宝石到相邻格子，或先点一颗再点旁边那颗",
      "en": "🖱️ Drag a gem onto a neighbor, or click one then its neighbor"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 102,
      "zh": "👆 触屏：手指按住宝石往任意方向一滑",
      "en": "👆 Touch: press a gem and flick in any direction"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 103,
      "zh": "✨ 换完连不成线会自动换回来，不扣步数",
      "en": "✨ Swaps that make no match bounce back for free"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 105,
      "zh": "💎 特殊宝石",
      "en": "💎 Special Gems"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 107,
      "zh": "4 个连成一线 → 条纹宝石，消掉整行或整列",
      "en": "4 in a line → Striped gem, clears a whole row or column"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 108,
      "zh": "L 形或 T 形 → 炸弹宝石，炸掉周围 3×3",
      "en": "L or T shape → Bomb gem, blasts a 3×3 area"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 109,
      "zh": "5 个连成一线 → 彩虹宝石，和谁交换就清掉全场那种颜色",
      "en": "5 in a line → Rainbow gem, swap it to clear every gem of that color"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 110,
      "zh": "两颗特殊宝石互相交换，会触发超级组合技！",
      "en": "Swap two special gems together for a super combo!"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 113,
      "zh": "🧠 连击秘诀",
      "en": "🧠 Combo Tips"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 114,
      "zh": "尽量在棋盘下方消除：上面的宝石掉下来更容易自动连锁，连锁层数越多倍率越高。看到 4 连、5 连的机会先别急着三消，攒出特殊宝石收益更大！",
      "en": "Match near the bottom: falling gems are more likely to cascade, and each cascade level raises the multiplier. When a 4 or 5 match is possible, hold off the plain three — special gems pay off much more!"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 118,
      "zh": "📖 关于这款游戏",
      "en": "📖 About this game"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 118,
      "zh": "宝石消除（三消 / Match-3）网页版：交换相邻的两颗宝石，让三颗或以上同色宝石连成一线即可消除。4 连生成条纹宝石，L/T 形生成炸弹宝石，5 连生成彩虹宝石，特殊宝石之间还能互相组合。共 15 个步数限制关卡，另有 90 秒限时冲分模式，支持提示和自动洗牌，鼠标与触屏都能流畅操作，完全免费。",
      "en": "Match-3 jewel puzzle in your browser: swap two neighboring gems to line up three or more of the same color. Four in a row makes a striped gem, L/T shapes make a bomb, five in a row makes a rainbow gem, and special gems can be combined. 15 move-limited levels plus a 90-second blitz mode, with hints and auto-shuffle. Smooth on mouse and touch, completely free."
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 119,
      "zh": "🕹️ 打开即玩 · 完全免费 · 支持鼠标和触屏",
      "en": "🕹️ Play instantly · Free · Mouse & touch"
    },
