    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 167,
      "zh": "ブラウザで遊べる3マッチパズル：隣り合う宝石を入れ替えて同じ色を3つ以上並べると消える。4つでストライプ、L/T字でボム、5つでレインボー宝石、スペシャル同士の組み合わせも。手数制限の15ステージと90秒タイムアタック、ヒント・自動シャッフル付き。マウス・タッチ対応、完全無料。",
      "en": "Match-3 jewel puzzle in your browser: swap two neighboring gems to line up three or more of the same color. Four in a row makes a striped gem, L/T shapes make a bomb, five in a row makes a rainbow gem, and special gems can be combined. 15 move-limited levels plus a 90-second blitz mode, with hints and auto-shuffle. Smooth on mouse and touch, completely free."
